Update MoltenVK to a main-branch build that allows 16 descriptor sets

KSA uses descriptor sets 0-9. The MoltenVK in Sikarugir wrappers (1.4.1, 1.4.2)
allows 8 (SPIRV-Cross kMaxArgumentBuffers), so some shaders fail with "cannot
reserve 'buffer' resource location" and the game crashes. SPIRV-Cross 76301541
raised it to 16 and MoltenVK main has used it since b0753ebc, but no release
(<= 1.4.2) includes it. This builds main at 5189f8de (2026-10-13).

Remove once the wrapper ships a MoltenVK release with the higher limit.
---
target wrapper:Frameworks/libMoltenVK.dylib
$ git clone https://github.com/KhronosGroup/MoltenVK.git && cd MoltenVK
$ git checkout 5189f8de86ec365860f63bf1da736815cfaea5cd
$ ./fetchDependencies --macos
$ make macos
$ cp Package/Release/MoltenVK/dynamic/dylib/macOS/libMoltenVK.dylib "$OUT"
$ cp LICENSE "$LICENSES/MoltenVK.txt"
$ cp External/SPIRV-Cross/LICENSE "$LICENSES/SPIRV-Cross.txt"
$ cp External/cereal/LICENSE "$LICENSES/cereal.txt"
$ cp External/Vulkan-Headers/LICENSE.md "$LICENSES/Vulkan-Headers.md"
